  "description": "The Wild Edge Team has impressively demonstrated its outstanding performance with successful appearances at the Cape Epic, the toughest mountain bike stage race in the world. Developed in close collaboration with the professionals of Team BULLS, the race bike offers most modern frame geometry and an innovative suspension concept.\n\nThanks to the new 4-link swing arm rear suspension, the ”workhorse” of the team pros has the best possible control on the descents and increased efficiency on the climbs. Together with the RockShox Ultimate components, this creates a chassis for use in the toughest XC marathon races in the world.\n\nWith a slightly steeper seat angle and a particularly low centre of gravity, the geometry of the monocoque carbon frame was also adapted again at the team's request. And it goes without saying that no compromises were made in the choice of components in the search for maximum racing performance. From the Rumble Altimate Pro carbon handlebar/stem unit to the\nRumble Escalator Ultra Dropper Post and Mavic Crossmax Carbon XLR wheels with Schwalbe Racing Ray / Racing Ralph Evo Super Race tyres - the Wild Edge Team is trimmed for performance down to the smallest screw.",
